title: "cgm-zig: the EchoSystems patch set on Zig"
abstract: "cgm-zig is the EchoSystems patch set on the Zig compiler: toolchain sovereignty for hyper-modular whole-closure builds, provenance first and rebase-friendly. Zig is by the Zig contributors, under the MIT licence."
